<title>USA: Tollgrade Communications Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Tollgrade Communications Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CHESWICK, Pa. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   9/30/96  9/30/95  9/30/96  9/30/95</p>
<p> Total Revenues		  $10,080 $5,307 $27,112   $16,645</p>
<p> Gross Profit			5,080  2,564  13,677     8,079</p>
<p> Operating Income		  2,130    745   5,909     3,089</p>
<p> Income before Income Tax	2,220    757   6,388     3,083</p>
<p> Net Income			  1,396    484   3,965     1,973</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		  .23    .11     .67	 .45</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares of</p>
<p>Common Stock and</p>
<p>  Equivalents		   5,940(A)  4,469   5,902     4,366</p>
<p>Note: (A) The increase in shares was primarily due to the sale of 1,490,000 new shares in the initial public offering and the exercise of stock options.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Tollgrade Communications Inc. (Unaudited; in thousands of dollars, except per-share data)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
